# CFF citation metadata. See https://citation-file-format.github.io/
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MusicDNA-Detector
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Experimental pitch and duration extraction from short monophonic humming and
  singing queries. It turns audio into a storable note representation (pitch in
  Hz, duration) for use in query-by-humming and query-by-singing systems over
  musicological catalogues and can be consumed downstream by the
  MusicDNA-Encoder.
authors:
